MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

What is the difference between H2O and Tessera?

It seems to me that on paper they have similar ambitions: allow for a smooth integration of different analytic paradigms, e.g.:

- in memory
- on hadoop

Do I get this right?

E.

